+			Records are ignored by <code>lombok.fieldDefaults.defaultPrivate</code> and <code>lombok.fieldDefaults.defaultFinal</code>. Using <code>@FieldDefaults</code> explicitly on a record is an error.
 		</p>
 	</@f.smallPrint>
 </@f.scaffold>
